cluding:</p><ul><li>Top quality cabinets, countertops &amp; hardware</li><li>Free kitchen design rendering</li><li>Selection assistance</li><li>Free estimates</li><li>In-house renovation contractors</li><li>Flexible financing</li></ul><p>We give you one point of contact throughout the entire process so you get top quality materials &amp; the high-touch service you really want!</p></div></div><div class="el-block"><h2>Our Remodeling Services Include:</h2><div class="el-text"><ul><li>Free design consultations</li><li>Help making all selections within your budget</li><li>Flexible financing</li><li>Tear out of your existing kitchen</li><li>Installing cabinets &amp; trim</li><li>Installing countertops &amp; appliances (if necessary)</li><li>Plumbing &amp; electrical hook ups</li></ul><p>Our remodeling experts are fully licensed &amp; insured.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Request a Free Consultation</a></p></div><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2020/04/remodeling-checklist-cta-banner.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Checklist, download now" width="800" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div></section>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/process-strip.njk" %}{% raw %}{% endraw %}
